1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,421
Jason pushed an empty wheelbarrow out of
the quarry. Their buyer paid

2
00:00:04,421 --> 00:00:07,000
anyway, The mountain had kept the decoy.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,421
Earlier, they'd brought two locked cases
to the weigh station. One held

4
00:00:11,421 --> 00:00:14,000
their score, the other their buyer's
payment.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,250
The buyer insisted both cases weigh the
same. Jason trusted the digital

6
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:21,000
display until it flickered.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,375
Lucia read the mechanical dial
underneath. Their buyer's case held

8
00:00:25,375 --> 00:00:28,000
stone, matched to the missing money.

9
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:33,688
They left both cases on the slope and
released the wheelbarrow brake under

10
00:00:33,688 --> 00:00:35,000
the buyer's camera.

11
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,053
The cases rolled toward the crusher's
loading trench. Lucia sent one

12
00:00:39,053 --> 00:00:42,000
message: transfer now, or neither case
comes back.

13
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:46,789
Payment arrived before Jason caught it.
He took their real case, left the

14
00:00:46,789 --> 00:00:49,000
rocks, and opened the side gate.

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:54,688
The camera saw empty hands and an empty
barrow. Lucia carried their score

16
00:00:54,688 --> 00:00:56,000
behind the wall.
